Cell["The red section is produced as \[Xi] ranges from 0 to 1.", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.730577720255582*^9, 
  3.730577757945553*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2f7076d2-4ce5-4b26-8f8c-\
